      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 4.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "hello, doctor. I think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 9.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "come in please sit how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.2,
      "end_seconds": 24.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "I wanted to get a bitten tongue looked at. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.93,
      "end_seconds": 28.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.73,
      "end_seconds": 32.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I've had it since last weekend"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.31,
      "end_seconds": 37.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.61,
      "end_seconds": 40.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "It feels mild to to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.04,
      "end_seconds": 45.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Have you had headache the next day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.93,
      "end_seconds": 55.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. With headache the next day, about a four out of ten. It comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.94,
      "end_seconds": 62.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Did you get second seizure, fever, loss of bladder control or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.73,
      "end_seconds": 66.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "So, none of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.7,
      "end_seconds": 70.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.5,
      "end_seconds": 74.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.53,
      "end_seconds": 78.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.83,
      "end_seconds": 92.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.53,
      "end_seconds": 97.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.39,
      "end_seconds": 101.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Epilepsy, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.78,
      "end_seconds": 102.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.56,
      "end_seconds": 125.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Right, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.23,
      "end_seconds": 131.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Yeah, I'm allergic to amoxicillin, I get a rash all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.53,
      "end_seconds": 145.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "So, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.77,
      "end_seconds": 154.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "I'm, I'm on sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day for the fits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.68,
      "end_seconds": 167.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.74,
      "end_seconds": 175.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Right, uh, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.55,
      "end_seconds": 178.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.72,
      "end_seconds": 193.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.18,
      "end_seconds": 220.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.5 degrees, SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse is 72 beats a minute, blood pressure 124 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.6,
      "end_seconds": 227.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.36,
      "end_seconds": 231.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.28,
      "end_seconds": 252.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "You are alert and your neurological examination is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.02,
      "end_seconds": 272.44,
      "duration_seconds": 17.42,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Okay, thinking it through, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at a breakthrough seizure after missed medication and poor sleep or a dose that is too low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.64,
      "end_seconds": 293.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'm sending you for an anticonvulsant level because of breakthrough seizure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.64,
      "end_seconds": 295.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.3,
      "end_seconds": 320.81,
      "duration_seconds": 23.51,
      "text": "take your medicine at the same time every day and do not drive until we say so. If it hasn't settled in a month, we'd think about blood tests, but not now. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.06,
      "end_seconds": 323.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.66,
      "end_seconds": 328.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "let's review you in four weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.48,
      "end_seconds": 330.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.01,
      "end_seconds": 336.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Okay, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.95,
      "end_seconds": 341.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.78,
      "end_seconds": 344.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
